@acl = http://localhost:6000
@legacy = http://localhost:6050

### ===== L04: Anti-Corruption Layer =====

### Legacy SOAP (faulty)
POST {{legacy}}/soap/billing/GetCustomerInvoices
Content-Type: text/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetCustomerInvoicesRequest xmlns="http://legacy.billing.corp/2005">
      <DOMAIN>example.com</DOMAIN>
    </GetCustomerInvoicesRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### ACL
GET {{acl}}/customers/example.com/payment-standing

### ACL - pojedyncza faktura
GET {{acl}}/invoices/EX-2024-001

### Legacy SOAP - pojedyncza faktura
POST {{legacy}}/soap/billing/GetInvoice
Content-Type: text/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetInvoiceRequest xmlns="http://legacy.billing.corp/2005">
      <INV_ID>EX-2024-001</INV_ID>
    </GetInvoiceRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Seeded data: devmentors.io (VIP, in good standing)
GET {{acl}}/customers/devmentors.io/payment-standing

### Seeded data: ticketflow.com (Premium, ~35 dni overdue)
GET {{acl}}/customers/ticketflow.com/payment-standing

### Legacy - health check
GET {{legacy}}/soap/billing/health
